    "Termind connects directly from this Mac over HTTP. Tools ask for approval before running by default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind会通过HTTP从这台Mac直接连接。默认情况下，工具运行前会请求批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Termind could not start an audio input. Check that a microphone is connected and available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind无法启动音频输入。请检查麦克风是否已连接且可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Termind reads the account name and stores the remaining key data as a secret." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind会读取账户名称，并将其余密钥数据作为机密信息保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Termind returns only a one-shot handle to the MCP client. The value is bound to this session, destination, ssh_exec, and purpose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind只向MCP客户端返回一次性句柄。该值绑定到当前会话、目标、ssh_exec和用途。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Termind stopped before this tool call's result was recorded. Whether the action completed is unknown; check the current state before doing it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind在记录此工具调用结果前已停止。操作是否完成尚不确定；再次执行前请检查当前状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Termind stopped waiting for this tool before it finished. Whether the action completed is unknown; check the current state before doing it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind在此工具完成前停止了等待。操作是否完成尚不确定；再次执行前请检查当前状态。"
          }
        }
